    <string name="rules_turn">TAP an adjacent room, then GO. Every move spends one supply.</string>
    <string name="rules_encounters">A room holds a survey mark, a trap, a crystal pocket, an empty gallery or the core.</string>
    <string name="rules_supplies">Supplies never refill. At zero the expedition ends where it stands.</string>
    <string name="rules_tools">USE TOOL answers a trap or a pocket for free, but each specialist has limited charges.</string>
    <string name="rules_extract">EXTRACT TEAM banks everything carried. Reaching the core ends the run with a bonus.</string>
    <string name="rules_fiction">Crystals are fiction. No wagering, no payouts, no real money.</string>

